## Installation

<InstallCommand shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/checkbox.json" />

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Checkbox } from "$lib/components/ui/checkbox/index.js";
</script>

<Checkbox aria-label="Accept terms" />
```

## API Reference

### Checkbox

`Checkbox` includes the COSS check and indeterminate indicators. Use `checked` for an initial value
or `bind:checked` for controlled state. Native form props and `onCheckedChange` pass to the Shards
root.

See the [Shards Checkbox API](https://shardsui.com/svelte/checkbox) for form, validation, and state
props.

## Examples

For accessible labelling and validation, prefer using the `Field` component to wrap checkboxes. See the related example: [Checkbox field](/docs/components/field#checkbox-field).

